{:name "work-a-note"
 :purpose "Work one projector note to the state its Done when line names: a workspace prepared from the note's full context, the work done there, the result for the owner to judge."
 :executor :either
 :skill "../../.claude/skills/pj-work"
 :procedure "Follow the pj-work skill, carried in full in the brief: resolve the note, check it can be worked (a project with repos, not blocked, a status), dry-run when anything is unusual, then pj work <id> to lay out one worktree per repo on one branch with AGENT_BRIEFING.md, and work the note there. pj work commits, pushes and merges nothing: the branch is left for the owner. Emit what was prepared (workspace path, repos, branch) into the attempt and end it; the owner judges the note's Done when line."
 :criterion "the note's Done when line holds, as the owner judges"
 :trigger {:manual true}
 :budget {:minutes 180}
 ;; the kernel's worktree spec took over: bin/kernel worktree <the note's intent>, which asks
 ;; projector about the note through the manifest's context command
 :superseded-by "worktree"}
